makes him a serious risk to invoke and more of a loss for his Seeker than their enemies.","text":"Derenzar lacks a defense power and his unruly behavior makes him a serious risk to invoke and more of a loss for his Seeker than their enemies."},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nFile:Derenzar_Icon.png|Derenzar's Icon\n</gallery>","text":"Image caption: Derenzar's Icon"},{"heading":"Trivia","level":2,"wikitext":"* Derenzar was unlocked on Huntik.com with the code '''ymir689'''.\n[[Category:Titans]]\n[[Category:Draco-Titans]]\n[[Category:Scout Titans]]\n[[Category:Organization Titans]]\n[[Category:TCG Titans]]\n{{Clear}}{{DracoBox}}","text":"• Derenzar was unlocked on Huntik.com with the code ymir689."}],"full_text":"Derenzar is a blue, reptilian Draco-Titan that is easily invoked but has been known to turn on its owner. It is an exception to the general rule of Draco-Titans being noble and chivalrous.\n\nHistory\n\nDerenzar was once invoked by one of DeFoe's French Suits but quickly turned on him. Sophie Casterwill explained this was normal behaviour for a Derenzar Titan. [SAS-079]\n\nAbilities\n\nDerenzar lacks a defense power and his unruly behavior makes him a serious risk to invoke and more of a loss for his Seeker than their enemies.\n\nGallery\n\nImage caption: Derenzar's Icon\n\nTrivia\n\n• Derenzar was unlocked on Huntik.com with the code ymir689.","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox Titan\n| image   = File:Derenzar.jpg\n| attack  = 3\n| defense = 1\n| type    = [[Draco-Titan]]\n| size    = \n| ability = \n| user    = [[Suits]]<br>[[Unnamed Suit 008]]\n| height  = 6 feet 3 inches\n| weight  = 210 pounds\n| first   = [[TCG:SAS-079|SAS-079]]\n}}'''Derenzar''' is a blue, reptilian [[Draco-Titan]] that is easily invoked but has been known to turn on its owner. It is an exception to the general rule of Draco-Titans being noble and chivalrous.\n\n== History ==\nDerenzar was once invoked by one of [[DeFoe]]'s French [[Suits]] but quickly turned on him. [[Sophie Casterwill]] explained this was normal behaviour for a Derenzar Titan. {{Source|TCG:SAS-079|SAS-079}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nDerenzar lacks a defense power and his unruly behavior makes him a serious risk to invoke and more of a loss for his Seeker than their enemies.\n== Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nFile:Derenzar_Icon.png|Derenzar's Icon\n</gallery>\n\n== Trivia ==\n* Derenzar was unlocked on Huntik.com with the code '''ymir689'''.\n[[Category:Titans]]\n[[Category:Draco-Titans]]\n[[Category:Scout Titans]]\n[[Category:Organization Titans]]\n[[Category:TCG Titans]]\n{{Clear}}{{DracoBox}}","categories":["Draco-Titans","Organization Titans","Scout Titans","TCG Titans","Titans"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:2831","status":"resolved","target_title":"Draco-Titan","label":"Draco-Titan","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Draco-Titan","href":"#/categories?name=Draco-Titans"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:17561","status":"resolved","target_title":"Unnamed Suit 008","label":"Unnamed Suit 008","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Unnamed_Suit_008","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A17561"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:6214","status":"resolved","target_title":"TCG:SAS-079","label":"SAS-079","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/TCG:SAS-079","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A6214"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2831","status":"resolved","target_title":"Draco-Titan","label":"Draco-Titan","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Draco-Titan","href":"#/categories?name=Draco-Titans"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2048","status":"resolved","target_title":"DeFoe","label":"DeFoe","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/DeFoe","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2048"},{"target_id":"hun